  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can feel the forces of life invigorating you as ki helps you to overcome the inherent frailties of the physical body. Minor wounds heal quickly and even greater wounds soon heal.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13, Wis 13, Healing Chakra.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can convert 1 point of damage you receive per attack into non-lethal damage for each point of ki invested.</p>\n<p>When you expend your ki focus, you receive 1 rank of fast healing per point of ki expended. This lasts for a number of rounds equal to your character level.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
